    "after": {
      "ngl": 0,
      "decode_tok_s": 17.22,
      "note": "Bridge.defaultNgl() demotes Adreno 6xx to CPU"
    },
    "gain": "4.4x"
  },
  "conclusions": [
    "The Adreno 618 GPU works. Earlier reports of 'no GPU enumerated' were three packaging bugs on our side, not a hardware floor.",
    "On this part the GPU is 4.7x SLOWER than the CPU for decode; the OpenCL path is tuned for A7X/A8X/X1E/X2E.",
    "Quantization changes the GPU result by ~3x: Q4_0 3.89 tok/s vs mixed-Q5_0 1.29 tok/s. Always state the quant.",
    "The Hexagon NPU is unreachable on this device: no /dev/cdsprpc-smd, audio-DSP fastrpc domains only, 0 of 18 skels are HTP/HMX."
